c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5JzpY-nMcFLBQZXb5j5JeyX-JryCAYEhRTr04oe2ax-w&oe=6A107A86"}, "display_name": "Paint Roller", "keywords": ["HyperCasual", "Paint", "Roller", "Comfort", "Fun"], "long_description": "Step into a world bursting with color in Paint Roller, a thrilling VR experience where creativity meets challenge! Take control of a virtual paint roller and transform blank environments into vibrant masterpieces. Navigate intricate levels, solve color-based puzzles, and spread paint in innovative ways to complete each challenge. With smooth VR mechanics, responsive controls, and immersive visuals, Paint Roller offers an artistic playground for casual and competitive players alike.\n\nIn Paint Roller, every movement matters! Tilt, spin, and swipe your roller to cover surfaces with precision. Dodge obstacles, unlock new brushes, and experiment with unique textures to achieve artistic perfection. Whether you're aiming for high scores or simply enjoying the relaxing flow of painting, the game adapts to your style.\n\nWith an array of levels and creative tools at your disposal, Paint Roller is more than a game\u2014it's an immersive painting adventure. Are you ready to grab your roller and paint your way to victory?", "short_description": "Get ready to roll and paint your way through a colorful adventure in Paint Roller! This VR game challenges you to navigate dynamic environments, spread vibrant colors, and complete creative challenges. Tilt, spin, and glide your paint roller across unique surfaces while overcoming fun obstacles. With immersive gameplay and engaging mechanics, Paint Roller delivers an artistic and exciting experience. Are you ready to unleash your inner painter?"}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nRyME7ipZKdK4JPdh6Aza7RPKWnEWmNI/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Esti Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url"